          "images": {}
        },
        "hints": [
          {
            "content": "To factor $x^2 + 5x + 6$, we need to find two numbers that:\n- Multiply to give 6\n- Add to give 5",
            "widgets": {},
            "images": {}
          },
          {
            "content": "The numbers 2 and 3 work:\n- $2 \\times 3 = 6$ ✓\n- $2 + 3 = 5$ ✓\n\nSo: $x^2 + 5x + 6 = (x + 2)(x + 3)$",
